WEBVTT

00:08:56.407 --> 00:09:00.494
lived in high-quality housing
with excellent sanitation.

00:09:00.911 --> 00:09:02.955
North of the Black Sea,

00:09:02.955 --> 00:09:05.416
in the modern country of Ukraine,

00:09:05.457 --> 00:09:09.295
archaeologists have found evidence
of even more ancient cities

00:09:09.336 --> 00:09:11.630
going back 6,000 years.

00:09:12.131 --> 00:09:13.382
And again,

00:09:13.424 --> 00:09:17.428
these huge settlements present no evidence

00:09:17.469 --> 00:09:20.556
of authoritarian rule.

00:09:21.056 --> 00:09:23.684
No temples, no palaces,

00:09:23.726 --> 00:09:26.353
not even any evidence
of central storage facilities

00:09:26.395 --> 00:09:28.522
or top-down bureaucracy.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:34.403
Actually what we see in those cases
are these great concentric rings of houses